<body><main>
<h1>Simul\xE1tor soustru\u017Een\xED \u2014 p\u0159\xEDru\u010Dka</h1>
<p class="lead">Jak simul\xE1tor ovl\xE1dat a jak ps\xE1t program. Str\xE1nku si m\u016F\u017Ee\u0161 nechat otev\u0159enou vedle simul\xE1toru nebo vytisknout.</p>
<div class="man">${xf}</div>
</main></body></html>`}var Ev="N10",oi={"Pod\xE9ln\xE9 soustru\u017Een\xED nahrubo":`(HRIDEL D50 -> D40 NA DELCE 60)
